<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>SIMBA AI — Local Preview</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@600;700&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" />
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Public Sans", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color: #161b18;
      background: #f7f8f7;
    }
    .fake-site { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 20px 120px; }
    .fake-site header {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e3e7e4; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .fake-site header img { height: 28px; width: auto; }
    .fake-site h1 {
      font-family: Manrope, Public Sans, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.1rem);
      color: #006b3c; margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .note {
      margin-top: 24px; padding: 12px 14px; background: #eaf5ee; border: 1px solid #e3e7e4;
      border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #626a65;
    }
    .site-nav a {
      margin-left: 14px; color: #006b3c; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="fake-site">
    <header>
      <img src="/widget/assets/taxsimba-logo.svg" alt="TaxSimba" height="28" />
      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Example host navigation">
        <a href="#packages">Packages</a>
        <a href="#calculators">Calculators</a>
        <a href="#help">Help</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <h1>SIMBA AI local embed preview</h1>
    <p>Floating launcher uses official TaxSimba branding. This host page is a sandbox — the live TaxSimba website is not modified.</p>
    <div class="note" id="packages">
      Open <strong>Ask SIMBA</strong> when ready. The chat never auto-opens. Demo/mock mode is used unless
      <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code> is configured server-side.
    </div>
    <p id="calculators" style="margin-top:20px;color:#626a65">Example content below the fold so you can check the launcher does not hide primary controls.</p>
    <p id="help" style="color:#626a65">Keyboard: Tab to Ask SIMBA, Enter to open, Escape to close.</p>
  </div>
  <script src="/widget/embed.js" data-api-base="http://127.0.0.1:8090"></script>
</body>
</html>
